  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_myrobalanen_cb0">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>myrobalanen, a light purgative (Heyd 627-30) | myrobalan, the astringent plum-like fruit of species of Terminalia (family Combretaceæ), a light purgative, used medically (OED s.v. myrobalan; Heyd 627-30)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
